class IncrementalSnapshot {
  /// Streams changes from the start and reads the collections in `chunk_size` chunks, in
  /// `_id` order, alongside them. Each chunk is released once the change stream has
  /// caught up with the moment it was read, and progress is stored in `checkpoint_cache`,
