  /// this needs no up-front snapshot phase and does not delay streaming. The two are
  /// mutually exclusive: both read the same documents, so enabling both would deliver
  /// everything twice.
  ///
  /// Default: `false`
  enabled: Boolean?

  /// The number of documents read per chunk. A released chunk is in flight as a whole, so
  /// it must not exceed `checkpoint_limit`, and keeping it well below leaves room for
  /// streamed changes and the next chunk alongside it.
  ///
  /// Default: `500`
  chunk_size: Int?

  /// The key used to store the incremental snapshot's progress in `checkpoint_cache`,
  /// alongside the stream position. Defaults to `checkpoint_key` with
  /// `_incremental_snapshot` appended, so inputs with distinct `checkpoint_key` values
  /// never share progress.
  ///
